  b) Perform, mix, and broadcast The Audio in live DJ sets, club venues, 
     private events, FM/web radio broadcasts, and non-monetized online DJ 
     mixes (e.g., SoundCloud, Mixcloud, Hearthis).
  c) Create private, unreleased personal edits or mashups strictly for use 
     within your own live DJ sets.

2. ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT
Whenever The Audio is included in a published tracklist, radio log, or online 
