  b) Upload, distribute, or monetize The Audio as standalone tracks on any 
     commercial streaming or download platform (including, but not limited to, 
     Spotify, Apple Music, Beatport, Bandcamp, Traxsource, or YouTube).
  c) Register The Audio, or any derivative work containing samples from The 
     Audio, with any audio fingerprinting or Content ID system (e.g., YouTube 
     Content ID, Meta Rights Manager, Shazam).
  d) Falsely claim authorship, production credit, or ownership of The Audio.

